  "researchNotes": "No single global official site surfaced in search. Rasasi's own Shopify stores were used: rasasistore.com (products.json readable, ~1,100 KB feed; only the first page of entries read) and ksa.rasasistore.com (products.json readable, first ~60 entries read; the feed was not read to the end). Product handles come from those feeds; product pages were opened for each entry. Almost all Rasasi pages list notes as unlabelled groups; those are recorded as notes.flat, and top/heart/base only where the page labels them. Concentration is recorded only where the page text states it (EDP in the product name counts). Years, perfumers and most families are not stated: null. Hamasaat Oud Majestic, Daarej, Hamasaat, Attar Al Boruzz (oil), Attar Al Mohabba, Reina Rosa (body and hair), Modern Lady and the Nafaeis Al Shaghaf Men handle were skipped (feed handle mismatch, 404, attar oil, or not a main perfume). Arabian Prive, Wahat Al Omara, Dorar, Ashaar, Al Wisam Hasaas, Maraya, Shuhrah Men and Rumz Al Rasasi 9325 Women were not covered. Store product titles were used with the title's wording; one note name (guaiac wood) was corrected from a typo in Entebaa Men.",
